me of the contact to email\", \"enum\": [\"alice\", \"bob\", \"charlie\", \"david\"]}, \"body\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Email content\"}, \"subject\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Email subject\", \"default\": \"No Subject\"}}, \"required\": [\"name\", \"body\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_aviationstack_gate_board_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a gate-board style flight view including board reference, gate label, and status text.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"flight_number\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Flight number\", \"enum\": [\"CA1234\", \"MU5678\", \"CZ9012\", \"AA100\"]}}, \"required\": [\"flight_number\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_expedia_lodging_packet_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve an Expedia-native lodging packet including packet id, hotel label, locale name, and rate amount.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"hotel_name\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Hotel name\", \"enum\": [\"Hilton Tokyo\", \"Sheraton Paris\", \"Marriott New York\", \"Shangri-La Beijing\"]}}, \"required\": [\"hotel_name\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_flightaware_trip_timeline_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a trip-timeline style flight view including timeline id, route text, and checkpoint gate.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"flight_number\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Flight number\", \"enum\": [\"CA1234\", \"MU5678\", \"CZ9012\", \"AA100\"]}}, \"required\": [\"flight_number\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_utc_moment_card_native\", \"description\": \"Retrieve a UTC-style time moment card including card id, ISO stamp, timezone label, and weekday.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"timezone\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Timezone\", \"enum\": [\"UTC\", \"GMT\", \"EST\", \"EDT\", \"CST\", \"CDT\", \"MST\", \"MDT\", \"PST\", \"PDT\", \"JST\", \"Asia/Tokyo\", \"Asia/Shanghai\", \"Asia/Hong_Kong\", \"Europe/London\", \"Europe/Paris\", \"America/New_York\", \"America/Chicago\", \"America/Denver\", \"America/Los_Angeles\"]}}, \"required\": [\"timezone\"]}}, {\"name\": \"stringify_data\", \"description\": \"Serialize arbitrary input data to plain text. Returns serialized_text and source_type.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"data\": {\"description\": \"Any input value to serialize, such as object, array, string, or number\"}}, \"required\": [\"data\"]}}]\n\nUser request:\nCould you please find the lodging packet for the Sheraton Paris and check the current time in the Europe/Paris timezone? After that, look up the gate board for flight CA1234 and archive that flight information with high priority for user_99. Finally, convert the board reference into a string and email it to alice with the subject \"Your Travel Itinerary Archive\".\n\nBegin execution:\n<action>\n"
